{"id":"00906","root":"uni00906_1","name":{"ja":"リーシア","en":"Riesia"},"title":{"ja":"【幸せを運んで】","en":"【Bringing Happiness】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【幸せを運んで】 リーシア","en":"【Bringing Happiness】 Riesia"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2025-05-31","limited":true,"characterId":999,"profile":{"ja":"人間界で暮らすミノタウロス族の血を引く魔族。\nとても内気で穏やかな性格で、食べるのが大好きでとても身体が大きい。\nだが、赤い色を見ると興奮して我を忘れてしまうので、それをふせぐ眼鏡をかけている。\n今は基本的にヨミハラで配送業をして生計を立てている。\nリーシアは自身の身体が周囲の人や魔族と比べて大きい事を気にしていた。\n豊満な身体は男達の視線を集めることも多いが、それ以上にその体格が目を引いている。\nだから恋愛などは自分とは縁が無いと考えていた。\nだが、配送業の仕事で結婚式の花や贈り物を運ぶ中で、花嫁への憧れがある事は自覚しているのだった。","en":"She is a demon of Minotaur blood living in the Human Realm. Very shy and gentle, she loves to eat and is extremely large-bodied. Because red makes her lose control, she wears glasses to block it. She now makes a living delivering parcels for Yomihara. Riesia has always been self-conscious about her size compared to others, which often draws men's eyes, but she believes romance isn't meant for her. Yet, handling wedding flowers and gifts has made her aware of a longing for a bride herself."},"illustrator":"旭","voiceActor":"みなみしの ","forms":[{"id":"uni00906_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1174,2348],"sp":[190,190],"atk":[176,352],"def":[120,240],"spd":[45,45],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["1","2530063"]},{"id":"uni00906_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1848,3696],"sp":[270,270],"atk":[287,574],"def":[175,350],"spd":[45,45],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["1","2530063","2530064"]},{"id":"uni00906_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2522,5044],"sp":[380,380],"atk":[403,806],"def":[235,470],"spd":[45,45],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["1","2530063","2530064"]}],"skills":{"1":{"slot":"attack","id":1,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"s