rrassed to talk like this in such an outfit… but don't worry, I'll do my job properly!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00906_1/uni00906_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"私、身体が大きいので……こういった衣装を着られるなんて思ってもみませんでした。ど、どうでしょう？　……似合ってますか？","en":"I'm so big… I never imagined I could wear a costume like this. How does it look? …Does it suit me?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00906_1/uni00906_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"他の子みたいに、私も恋愛ができたら……結婚もできるんでしょうか。この見た目を好きになってくれる人って……いるんですかね、あはは","en":"If I could fall in love like the others… could I even get married? Is there anyone who could love someone with this appearance…? Ahaha."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00906_1/uni00906_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"仕事で新郎新婦さんに接することもあるんです。みなさん、本当に幸せそうで……見ているこっちまで幸せな気分になれるんですよね","en":"I sometimes meet the bride and groom at work. Everyone looks so happy… it even makes me feel happy just watching."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00906_1/uni00906_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"ふ、普段の格好からすると……かなり肌をさらしてますよね。特に胸元とか……すっごく恥ずかしいです！　あぁ、早く慣れないと……","en":"Compared to my usual clothes, this outfit shows a lot of skin… especially around the chest… I'm so embarrassed! Ah, I need to get used to it quickly."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00906_1/uni00906_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"ウェディングドレスを着ても、眼鏡は手放せませんよっ！　だ、だって、お花とかドレスって赤が使われていることが多くないですか？","en":"Even in a wedding dress, I can't ditch my glasses! Because, well, flowers and dresses often use red, don't they?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00906_1/uni00906_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"結婚式って、たくさんお料理が出てきますよね……。どれもこれも美味しそうで、全部食べたくなります。あぁっ！　いけないいけない……","en":"Weddings have so many dishes… they all look delicious, and I want to eat everything. Ah! I shouldn't…"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00906_1/uni00906_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"写真を撮るときに、花嫁さんを花婿さんがお姫様抱っこしたりしますよね。で、でも私は重いから無理なんだろうなって思うんです。残念っ","en":"When taking photos, the groom often carries the bride like a princess. But I'm heavy, so I guess I couldn't do that… what a shame."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00906_1/uni00906_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":1,"text":{"ja":"お、おっぱいからミルクが止まりませんっ！！　んぁああっ！　ドレスが汚れちゃうのにっ、どんどん出てきちゃうんですぅううっ！！","en":"My… milk won't stop coming out!! Ahhh! My dress is getting dirty, and it just keeps flowing!!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00906_1_hom_r18_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":2,"text":{"ja":"おっぱい、飲みたいんですか？　え、えーっと……それなら、オマンコにチンポを挿れてくれたら、もっとたくさん出てきますので……","en":"Do you want to drink my breasts? Uh, if that's what you want... then if you put your thing in my hole, I'll produce a lot more..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00906_1_hom_r18_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":3,"text":{"ja":"んはぁっ！　エッチなお嫁さんでごめんなさいっ！！　でも……もう耐えられないんですっ。おっぱい搾って、交尾お願いしますぅううう！","en":"Nnhaa! Sorry for being a lewd wife!! But... I just can't hold on anymore. Please squeeze my breasts and have sex with me, I'm begging you!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00906_1_hom_r18_3.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00906_1/uni00906_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00906_1/uni00906_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00906_1/uni00906_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00906_1/uni00906_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00906_1/uni00906_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio